(text "Q804 Q805 Q806 LAB ONLY. ENABLE_LOGIC_5V_LAB requires FUTURE INDEPENDENT qualified power-good. Q806 E1 B2 C3, R2103 4k7, R2104 100k OFF bias; KSP42BU candidate VCEO300V exceeds static 48V envelope, but no transient qualification. R2102 Vishay PR01 THT 10k 1W P70 candidate. Actual 6.5x2.5mm body nominal; DIN0207 generic footprint only. Vsource48V theoretical fault P=0.2425W at Rmin9.5k; no OEM thermal or pulse approval. D2101 D2102 Microchip 1N4106-1 low-current candidate. 250uA data not global VGS proof. Dual OPEN and common driver faults remain. NO FAB. NO FAB / NO TX / NO BATTERIA / NO VEICOLO." (at 200.66 271.78 0)(effects (font (size 1 1)))(uuid "f301db05-0000-4000-8000-000000000025"))
